        17
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forest_City%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "After the 1868 Missouri River flood rerouted westward, Forest City was left more than 2.5 miles from the river.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        5,
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Forest_City%2C_Missouri"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Forest City's City Hall was listed on the National Register of Historic Places in 1980.",
